## Fixed runbook (no improvisation)

Execute in order. End turn only at publish glance (or hard blocker).

### 0) Prep + draft (parallel)
1. `python …/SCRIPT-PrepListingUpload.py <base> --ensure-cors`
2. Lock existing 7dtdmods tab (or navigate dashboard → lock)
3. `POST /v1/mods` with `game_id: 01KJ17JZEVXHAX9SH1VNMKZFMC` → open `/mods/{mod_id}/edit/details`

### 1) Navigate ready (every URL hop)
After `browser_navigate`, **do not** snapshot an empty document.
CDP poll ≤300ms until `#mod-title` exists (or `input[type=file]` on media/files), max ~3s. Then act.

### 2) Details — core fields (one CDP)
From `fill.json`: set title + summary; Comments **off**. No typing.

### 3) Details — dropdowns (one snapshot, then click chain)
**One** interactive snapshot only.
Then: category(ies) → Escape → `V3 Mods` → Escape → `server_side` → Escape.
- **VP / VPS:** `fill.json.categories` already includes primary + Quality of Life when needed.
- Search filter short (`V3`, `Quality`, …) then click exact option.
- **Never** leave a listbox open. Open listboxes steal the next click.
- **No** mid-dropdown re-snapshots unless a click failed.

### 4) Details — Import (same turn as Escape from side)
Clear description first (Import **appends**). BBCode → Import → paste into **dialog** textarea → Import confirm.
- **Paste payload = raw `description.html` bytes** from `fill.description_url` (HTML `<span>` / `<h1>` / `<ul>`). That is what Import expects.
- **Forbidden:** `textContent` / `innerText` strip; rewriting to `[color]`/`[b]` BBCode; pasting only Preview plain text.
- **One CDP** after Import opens: `fetch(description_url)` → textarea `.value=` via prototype setter → `InputEvent('input', {inputType:'insertFromPaste', …})` (+ `input`/`change`) → **wait until Import is enabled** → click Import.
- **Never** click Import while `disabled`. Plain `.value=` / ordinary `input` without `insertFromPaste` can leave it disabled (AutomobilesRespawn).
- After import: Edit/Preview must show **color spans + headings + lists**, not bare `──` lines only. If wrong: clear, re-Import with raw HTML.
- If BBCode click intercepted: `scrollIntoView({block:'center'})` + click again. **Never reload** Details.
- Do not open Import and end the turn.

### 5) Media (one CDP chain + verify)
URL → `/edit/media` → wait-ready → thumb `input[0]` = `fill.thumb` → poll until Thumbnail slot shows an `/images/` img → gallery `input[2]` each `fill.gallery[]` **one file at a time** (never Featured `[1]`, never Under2MB in gallery).
**Hard verify before leaving Media:** Featured empty; Thumbnail has 1 image; Gallery card count === `fill.gallery.length` (count imgs whose nearest heading is **Gallery Images**, not total page `/images/` count — thumb+gallery both match `/images/` and fooled ArcheryFeathers).

### 6) Changelog (one CDP chain preferred)
URL → `/edit/changelog` → wait-ready → New Entry → `#new-version` = `fill.version` (`browser_type` slowly **or** CDP that still enables Create) → Create Entry → `insertText` body into **Changelog** ProseMirror (near heading Changelog / empty entry editor — **not** Description). Confirm `#mod-title` unchanged.

### 7) Files (upload CDP, then fill tools for meta)
URL → `/edit/files` → wait-ready → assign `fill.zip` → when name visible: **`browser_fill`** Label=`zip_label`, Desc=`zip_description`, Version=`zip_version` → Main Mod → file-row **Save** → **re-open pencil and confirm all three non-empty** (CDP `.value=` alone saves blank — AmmoDisassembly bug) → Show permissions on → Disallow×4 → Credits by heading (`fill.credits`). **Never** fill Download Instructions. Confirm `#mod-title`.

### 8) Publish glance
URL → `/edit/publish` → screenshot once → confirm requirements green + Credits text → unlock → delete `_listing_upload/*` copies (keep scripts) → chat: draft URL + filled summary. **Stop.** Never agree / Publish.

