## Hard lessons (do not repeat)

### Media
Source: `00_Images/02_ImagesFinal/` (or packet §5). Slot files are `ModName_01.png`, `_02.png`, … Ignore `*_Under2MB.png` in gallery list. Thumb uses Under2MB when present.

**Never** assign Featured (input `[1]`). **Never** multi-file gallery DataTransfer.

### Field isolation
- Changelog version → `#new-version` only
- Credits → Credits heading only (AlternativeRecipes bug: index-based PM wrote Download Instructions)
- After bulk CDP: `#mod-title` must still match `fill.title`
- Permissions: Disallow buttons only — never page-wide combobox walk

### Dropdowns
Reka/Vue comboboxes: snapshot once → click combo → optional search → click option → **Escape**. Failure → one fresh snapshot + retry that dropdown only.

### Import / dialogs
Known UIs — **open → fill same beat**:

| Open | Fill next |
|---|---|
| Import dialog | **raw** `description.html` + `insertFromPaste` → confirm **only if enabled** |
| New Entry / version | `fill.version` → Create → `fill.changelog_body` |
| Zip row editor | **`browser_fill`** label/desc/version → Main Mod → Save → re-open pencil confirm |
| Permissions | Show on → click **Disallow** once per row (do not toggle loops) |
| Credits | Label/heading **Credits** only (`fill.credits`); publish page often has Credits |

### Import failure modes (AutomobilesRespawn)
- Stripped HTML → plain lines, no colors → **wrong even if dialog Preview looks “readable”**
- Clicked disabled Import → thought it worked / partial plain paste
- After summary, invented a “cleaner” paste instead of mirroring the last good CDP

## Speed contract (self-audit)

User asked to **find** lag, not only react to named stalls. Before ending a fill turn, check:

1. Did I open a dialog/listbox/editor without filling it in the **same** turn? → Fix: chain fill.
2. Did I snapshot an empty navigated page? → Fix: poll ready first.
3. Did I re-read packet/transcript mid-fill (not the post-summary Import re-read)? → Fix: use `fill.json` only.
4. Did I call GetDynamicTools / mid-fill API GET / extra screenshot? → Drop unless failed.
5. Did I fill by ProseMirror **index** instead of heading? → Use heading (Credits vs Download Instructions).
6. Did I narrate “next I’ll…” between identical steps? → Tools only until publish glance.
7. Can title+summary+comments / Import paste+confirm / zip+meta+perms+credits be **one CDP each**? → Prefer yes.
8. Did I change a working Import/media/zip recipe “just this once”? → **Stop.** Use the locked recipe.

Target: continuous tools until publish glance; chat only at end.
